      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know how to explain it. everything looks fine on the outside. i have a good house, a job that pays well, people who care about me... but it all feels so fake. like i’m watching a movie of someone else’s life. there is just this huge, empty grayness inside me all the time and i cant make it stop. i feel like i have no right to even feel this way because i should be happy, but i just feel nothing.",
